{"id":7,"titleZh":"什么是协奏曲？","titleEn":"What Is a Concerto?","date":"1959-03-28","dateZh":"1959 年 3 月 28 日","concepts":"大协奏曲、独奏小组、华彩段、乐队协奏曲","thesis":"协奏曲的历史一路精简独奏人数：从巴洛克的几人小组变成一位炫技巨星与百人乐队对话，到了现代又反过来让全团人人都当独奏家。","plain":"协奏曲（Concerto）原意是“齐心协力”。巴洛克大协奏曲让一小拨乐手（Concertino）和大合奏轮流接话；后来乐队越扩越大，台前却浓缩成一名独奏主角，甚至在乐队停下来时独自完成高难度华彩段；20 世纪的巴托克干脆写出全团百人轮流炫技的《乐队协奏曲》。","scenes":["舞台人数从少到多直观推进：先是 23 人小编制奏维瓦尔第（竖琴代古琉特琴、小号代海号），随后在巴赫《第五勃兰登堡协奏曲》里精简到小提琴、长笛加伯恩斯坦亲自坐奏羽管键琴的三人小组。","再演莫扎特小提琴中提琴双独奏、门德尔松单一小提琴独奏（伴高难度华彩），最终满编百人登台奏响巴托克《乐队协奏曲》。"],"category":"基础乐理","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1fE411R7yn","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1fE411R7yn","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 什么是协奏曲？","duration":"59:29","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/what-is-a-concerto","repertoire":[{"composer":"Vivaldi","piece":"Concerto for Two Mandolins in G Major, RV 532 / C Major Ensemble","titleZh":"双曼陀林与乐队协奏曲","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Vivaldi%20Concerto%20for%20Two%20Mandolins%20in%20G%20Major%2C%20RV%20532%20/%20C%20Major%20Ensemble+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Vivaldi%20Concerto%20for%20Two%20Mandolins%20in%20G%20Major%2C%20RV%20532%20/%20C%20Major%20Ensemble"},{"composer":"J. S. Bach","piece":"Brandenburg Concerto No. 5 in D Major","titleZh":"第五勃兰登堡协奏曲","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/b6/f6/bb/b6f6bb25-85a1-c4fe-c503-7a3b726efbf0/mzaf_6199368927102673475.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/brandenburg-concerto-no-5-in-d-major-bwv-1050-i-allegro/1582007762?i=1582009005&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Akademie für Alte Musik Berlin","recordingTrack":"Brandenburg Concerto No. 5 in D Major, BWV 1050: I. Allegro","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=J.%20S.%20Bach%20Brandenburg%20Concert